      "open": "/* ====================================================================\n * People [kpadopt5-people]: the list of ways to sign in and the\n * conversation in bubbles. (The avatar extends .kp-idmark, and the chart\n * annotations extend .kp-chart, where those are.)\n *\n *   .kp-passkeys      passkeys, magic links, passwords and tokens, one row\n *                     each, with Rename and Remove (chassis `passkeys.html`,\n *                     JobTracker `Account.jsx`)\n *   .kp-thread        messages as bubbles, in on the start side, out on the\n *                     end side, system lines centred (JobTracker\n *                     `Correspondence.jsx`)\n *\n * Behaviour: js/passkeys.js and js/thread.js. Drawn from the tokens alone\n * until each register answers them (gates/register-pending.json).\n * ==================================================================== */\n@layer kp.components {\n",
